### Postgres ###
# Never commit the live Postgres data directory. The DB is a Docker named
# volume (see postgres/docker-compose.yml) and is rebuilt from Flyway
# migrations on first start. Committing it shipped a half-migrated database
# that broke teammates with cascading Flyway failures (V4/V6/... already exists).
postgres/data/
.env